# Implementation Plan - PDF Conversion & Deletion Fixes

This plan outlines the steps to implement PDF-to-DOCX conversion during upload, add file deletion in the Files Directory, and fix the broken deletion functionality in the linguistic tables.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - PDF conversion using `pdf2docx` might vary in quality depending on the PDF structure. The user will be able to refine the converted text in the Dashboard.
> - Deleting a file from the "Files Directory" will permanently remove its database records (alignments, project metadata) and the physical file from the server.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend - PDF Conversion & Project Deletion

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/backend/main.py)
- Update `upload_file` endpoint:
    - Check if the uploaded file is a PDF.
    - If PDF, save it, convert it to DOCX using `pdf2docx.Converter`, and then process the resulting DOCX.
    - Ensure the PDF is also stored if needed, or just the converted DOCX.
- Implement/Fix `@app.delete("/api/projects/{project_id}")`:
    - Call the DB to delete metadata and alignments.
    - Use `os.remove` to delete the physical file from `backend/uploads/`.

#### [MODIFY] [db.py](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/backend/db.py)
- Ensure `delete_project` correctly removes ALL associated data from `projects` and `alignments` tables.
- Add a helper to get the file path before deletion if not already present.

### Frontend - UI Updates & Bug Fixes

#### [MODIFY] [Rules DB](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/frontend/app/rules/page.tsx) (and related components)
- Fix the `onDelete` handler to correctly call `DELETE /api/admin/rules/{id}`.
- Ensure the state is updated locally after a successful deletion.

#### [MODIFY] [Linguistic Tables](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/frontend/app/linguistic/[category]/page.tsx)
- Fix deletion for Annotated Words, Disputed Words, Abbreviations, and Paragraphs.
- Ensure they call `DELETE /api/linguistic/delete/{category}/{id}`.

#### [MODIFY] [Files Directory](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/frontend/app/files/page.tsx)
- Add a "Delete" icon/button to the file cards.
- Implement the deletion logic with a confirmation dialog.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Upload a test PDF file and verify it appears in the Dashboard as editable text.
- Upload a DOCX file and verify normal processing.
- Delete a project and verify:
    - It disappears from the UI.
    - Database records are gone.
    - Physical file in `backend/uploads` is deleted.
- Delete a rule/annotated word and verify it's removed from the DB and UI.

